{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】香港迪士尼樂園明天起推出一系列聖誕主題活動。</p>\n<p>南韓人氣女團成員張員瑛在美國小鎮大街主持聖誕樹亮燈儀式，無人機拼出不同節日圖案，吸引不少人用手機拍攝。魔雪奇緣園區亦掛上聖誕裝飾，設有冬日市集售賣聖誕限定商品，樂園除夕亦會舉辦倒數活動。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:38:17.958734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:51:38.116014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:31:25.159683+00:00","content_hash":"b67811d2823bb3e04ab42a9fb9ccd09ab6cf2a7e2d7b817e295331f513f4a261","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}